"rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T09:22:50-07:00","id":947815,"title":"","content":"I'm enjoying the fluff and style you've got going for these.<br /> <br /> I know other people don't love mirror charms, but I don't mind them, especially because you're adding unique ones. I really like the one that lets Abyssals tunnel underground for instance, but a part of me can't help but wonder if that's a particularly hilarious way to just... get out of a fight. I imagine one Abyssal doing it by just stomping his foot down and lowering into the ground.<br /> <br /> Anyhow, I like the work you've been doing so far, and I appreciate it. If I have any deathknights pop up in my game, I'll definitely be eyeballing a bunch of these to give them a style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T09:49:04-07:00","id":947827,"title":"","content":"I don't hate them, but it is a bit disappointing to look at a charm tree and see nothing but mirror charms (as in 2e, Athletics off the top of my head was 100% mirrors if I'm not mistaken), it doesn't really give them a feel of being their own exalts.<br /> <br /> Thank you for the kind words, though, I enjoy knowing someone aside from just me is looking at these.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/944864-abyssals-in-death-s-dream-kingdom-homebrew-wip-peach\" targ